    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/575790007251e774e3f91f32cf05b627.avif?t=1748533422\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany Dan and Claire on their journey throughout the years and witness the birth of their new home. Will their reach their dreams, or will the dreams betray them and become nightmares?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/6a0b1bd0fdc0ff302d18fad601ed7062.poster.avif?t=1748533422\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/6a0b1bd0fdc0ff302d18fad601ed7062.webm?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/6a0b1bd0fdc0ff302d18fad601ed7062.mp4?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a life story unfolding with every room you renovate, and discover the secrets, that maybe should have been buried for eternity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/1e8a7337e4166f0e3b9244ee05767a3c.poster.avif?t=1748533422\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/1e8a7337e4166f0e3b9244ee05767a3c.webm?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/1e8a7337e4166f0e3b9244ee05767a3c.mp4?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each space will create a lasting impression, giving Dan access to its Mental Image. This will allow him to come back and explore them at any time in the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/d84b216a01e820914d892a61ab20dc7a.poster.avif?t=1748533422\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/d84b216a01e820914d892a61ab20dc7a.webm?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556810/extras/d84b216a01e820914d892a61ab20dc7a.mp4?t=1748533422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the warm glow of the afternoon wanes\u2026that\u2019s when the real struggle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
